# Dashboard Chat Insights

This directory contains markdown review files created by the dashboard chat agent.

The chat agent can create insights/review files here to document:
- Code quality analysis
- Architecture reviews
- Metric correlation findings
- Technical debt assessments
- Best practice recommendations

Files are named with timestamps: `insight_YYYY-MM-DD_HH-mm-ss.md`

This is the ONLY location where the dashboard chat agent can write files.
